Z||000000||Oreif||07-04-2000||11:08 AM||||I bought the carbon fiber dash kit from Daytona Dash for $150. I have installed it today and my rating on a scale of 1 to 10 is about a 7. The only 2 pieces that need work is the speedo/tack panel and the radio section. The radio section screw holes are slightly off. On the speedo and tach holes the cut-outs for them are slightly larger than the original cut-outs and the light section is one large hole. I had to paint the original panel black so it looks better. As for the quality and finish they are great!<BR>I will post some pics later. Right now I gotta get some Ice for the beer!<BR>Happy 4th of July!!!!<P>------------------<BR>~Oreif~<BR>Fieroholic and proud of it!||||reg||2
